<title>GERMANY: Oct German M3 money supply growth steady 8.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Oct German M3 money supply growth steady 8.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank gave the following data for German M3 money supply growth in November.</p>
<p>						   Oct 96	  Sept 96</p>
<p>Annualised vs average Q4 1995	    8.4		8.4</p>
<p>Non-annualised vs average Q4 1995	7.7		6.9</p>
<p>Note - The Bundesbank's target range for 1996 M3 money supply growth is four percent to seven percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
